{"suttaId":"thi-ap40","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[10617,10673],"vripara":"220"},"segments":{"thi-ap40:0.3":"Pesalātherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap40:1.1":"“Imamhi bhaddake kappe, brahmabandhu mahāyaso;","thi-ap40:1.3":"Kassapo nāma gottena, uppajji vadataṃ varo.","thi-ap40:2.1":"“Sāvatthiyaṃ pure vare, upāsakakule ahaṃ;","thi-ap40:2.3":"Pasūtā taṃ [naṃ (syā.)] jinavaraṃ, disvā sutvā ca desanaṃ.","thi-ap40:3.1":"“Taṃ vīraṃ saraṇaṃ gantvā, sīlāni ca samādiyiṃ;","thi-ap40:3.3":"Kadāci so mahāvīro, mahājanasamāgame.","thi-ap40:4.1":"“Attano abhisambodhiṃ, pakāsesi narāsabho;","thi-ap40:4.3":"Ananussutadhammesu, pubbe dukkhādikesu ca.","thi-ap40:5.1":"“Cakkhu ñāṇañca paññā ca, vijjāloko ca āsi me;","thi-ap40:5.3":"Taṃ sutvā uggahetvāna, paripucchiñca bhikkhavo.","thi-ap40:6.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","thi-ap40:6.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","thi-ap40:7.1":"“Pacchime ca bhave dāni, jātā seṭṭhimahākule;","thi-ap40:7.3":"Upecca buddhaṃ saddhammaṃ, sutvā saccūpasaṃhitaṃ.","thi-ap40:8.1":"“Pabbajitvācireneva, saccatthāni [sabbatthāni (syā. ka.)] vicintayaṃ;","thi-ap40:8.3":"Khepetvā āsave sabbe, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ.","thi-ap40:9.1":"“Iddhīsu ca vasī homi, dibbāya sotadhātuyā;","thi-ap40:9.3":"Cetopariyañāṇassa, vasī homi mahāmune.","thi-ap40:10.1":"“Pubbenivāsaṃ jānāmi, dibbacakkhu visodhitaṃ;","thi-ap40:10.3":"Sabbāsavaparikkhīṇā, natthi dāni punabbhavo.","thi-ap40:11.1":"“Atthadhammaniruttīsu, paṭibhāne tatheva ca;","thi-ap40:11.3":"Ñāṇaṃ me vimalaṃ suddhaṃ, buddhaseṭṭhassa vāhasā.","thi-ap40:12.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ, bhavā sabbe samūhatā;","thi-ap40:12.3":"Nāgīva bandhanaṃ chetvā, viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap40:13.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi, mama buddhassa santike;","thi-ap40:13.3":"Tisso vijjā anuppattā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap40:14.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","thi-ap40:14.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap40:15.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ pesalā [selā (syā. pī.)] bhikkhunī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap40:16.1":"Pesalātheriyāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","thi-ap40:16.2":"Khattiyāvaggo catuttho.","thi-ap40:17.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","thi-ap40:18.1":"Khattiyā brāhmaṇī ceva, tathā uppaladāyikā;","thi-ap40:18.3":"Siṅgālamātā sukkā ca, abhirūpā aḍḍhakāsikā.","thi-ap40:19.1":"Puṇṇā ca ambapālī ca, pesalāti ca tā dasa;","thi-ap40:19.3":"Gāthāyo dvisatānettha, dvicattālīsa cuttari.","thi-ap40:20.1":"Atha vagguddānaṃ –","thi-ap40:21.1":"Sumedhā ekūposathā, kuṇḍalakesī khattiyā;","thi-ap40:21.3":"Sahassaṃ tisatā gāthā, sattatālīsa piṇḍitā.","thi-ap40:22.1":"Saha uddānagāthāhi, gaṇitāyo vibhāvibhi;","thi-ap40:22.3":"Sahassaṃ tisataṃ gāthā, sattapaññāsameva cāti.","thi-ap40:23.1":"Therikāpadānaṃ samattaṃ.","thi-ap40:24.1":"Apadānapāḷi samattā."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
